   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A file tool names a path, so omega can check\nwhere it points (after following links and ..).\nA shell command is not a path, so there is\nnothing to check. So run_shell is asked\nabout everywhere, inside or outside.",
