   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The model reads a description AFTER it has picked the tool.\n'Use read_file, not cat' is advice about PICKING, so it lives in\nthe standing instructions. It is a safety rule too: cat through\nthe shell skips the file tools' location check.",
