   "locked": false,
   "text": "/rewind 1 counts in QUESTIONS,\nnot messages: one question can\nbe a dozen messages.\n\nA rewind is a line in the file\ntoo. Reading back = replay the\nfile to find the tip, then\nfollow parent_id to the root.",
   "originalText": "/rewind 1 counts in QUESTIONS,\nnot messages: one question can\nbe a dozen messages.\n\nA rewind is a line in the file\ntoo. Reading back = replay the\nfile to find the tip, then\nfollow parent_id to the root.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "s8_bug",
   "x": 880,
   "y": 9636.25,
   "width": 489.59999999999997,
   "height": 21.25,
   "strokeColor": "#b91c1c",
